	(text " - +3V3: MP2143DJ 3A buck (EVKB U39: L22 1uH, 22uF+10uF+0.1uF out, 2x10uF+0.1uF in, FB 180k/40.2k -> 3.29V). EN = PMIC_ON_REQ through 10k + 0.22uF (EVKB R266/C168, J71 1-2):"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 246.63 0)
		(effects
