	)
	(text " - VLDO_3V3: AP2112K-3.3 always-on LDO replaces the EVKB UM1750S; feeds VDD_SNVS_IN through D5 (EVKB D9 RB521S30, J28 1-2) so a coin cell can be ORed in later."
