	(text " - Rails: VDD_LPSR_IN, DCDC_IN, NVCC_GPIO/EMC/LPSR/DISP1/DISP2 = +3V3; ADC_VREFH, NVCC_SD1 (M.2 SDIO) = +1V8; NVCC_SD2 (flash + microSD) = +3V3 via FB6 (GPIO sheet); VDDA_ADC_3P3/VDDA_1P8 via FB1/FB2 (Power sheet)."
